title: HyperGSD plugin library
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

The ''HyperGSD plugin library'' let you install each plugin in the HyperGSD family and have easy updates, without ever leaving your wiki.

To use it in your wiki, drag the [[$:/config/HyperGSDPluginLibrary]] tiddler into your wiki and import it.
You can then access the plugin library from ''Control panel'' →&nbsp;''Plugins'' →&nbsp;''Get more plugins'' →&nbsp;''HyperGSD plugin library''.

Once the plugin/sub-plugins are installed, the ''Updates'' tab will list newer versions of the plugin and let you update with ease.